    public async Task<CatalogResult<RiderResponse[]>> GetRidersAsync(CancellationToken token)=>CatalogResult<RiderResponse[]>.Success((await dbContext.Riders.AsNoTracking().OrderBy(x=>x.Code).ToArrayAsync(token)).Select(Map).ToArray());
    public async Task<CatalogResult<RiderResponse>> CreateRiderAsync(CreateRiderRequest request,CatalogRequestContext context,CancellationToken token){var errors=ValidateCodeName(request.Code,request.Name).ToList();if(!IsInternationalPhone(request.Phone))errors.Add("A rider phone with country code is required (+ and 8 to 15 digits).");if(errors.Count>0)return Validation<RiderResponse>(errors.ToArray());if(await CodeExistsAsync(dbContext.Riders,request.Code,null,token))return Conflict<RiderResponse>("The rider code already exists.");var entity=New<Rider>(context);entity.Code=Code(request.Code);entity.Name=request.Name.Trim();entity.Phone=request.Phone.Trim();entity.VehicleRegistration=request.VehicleRegistration.Trim();entity.IsAvailable=request.IsAvailable;dbContext.Riders.Add(entity);AddStatus(entity,"Created",context);return await SaveAsync(()=>Map(entity),token);}
    public async Task<CatalogResult<RiderResponse>> UpdateRiderAsync(Guid id,UpdateRiderRequest request,CatalogRequestContext context,CancellationToken token){var entity=await dbContext.Riders.SingleOrDefaultAsync(x=>x.Id==id,token);if(entity is null)return NotFound<RiderResponse>();var errors=ValidateCodeName(request.Code,request.Name).ToList();if(!IsInternationalPhone(request.Phone))errors.Add("A rider phone with country code is required (+ and 8 to 15 digits).");if(errors.Count>0)return Validation<RiderResponse>(errors.ToArray());if(!ApplyVersion(entity,request.Version))return VersionFailure<RiderResponse>();if(await CodeExistsAsync(dbContext.Riders,request.Code,id,token))return Conflict<RiderResponse>("The rider code already exists.");UpdateStatus(entity,request.IsActive,request.Reason,context);entity.Code=Code(request.Code);entity.Name=request.Name.Trim();entity.Phone=request.Phone.Trim();entity.VehicleRegistration=request.VehicleRegistration.Trim();entity.IsAvailable=request.IsAvailable;Touch(entity,context);return await SaveAsync(()=>Map(entity),token);}

    public async Task<CatalogResult<RecipeResponse[]>> GetRecipesAsync(CancellationToken token) { var entities=await dbContext.Recipes.AsNoTracking().Include(x=>x.Lines).OrderBy(x=>x.Code).ToArrayAsync(token);return CatalogResult<RecipeResponse[]>.Success(entities.Select(Map).ToArray()); }
    public async Task<CatalogResult<RecipeResponse>> CreateRecipeAsync(CreateRecipeRequest request,CatalogRequestContext context,CancellationToken token){var errors=await ValidateRecipeAsync(request.Code,request.Name,request.MenuItemId,request.YieldQuantity,request.YieldUnitOfMeasureId,request.Lines,null,token);if(errors.Length>0)return Validation<RecipeResponse>(errors);var entity=New<Recipe>(context);entity.Code=Code(request.Code);entity.Name=request.Name.Trim();entity.MenuItemId=request.MenuItemId;entity.YieldQuantity=request.YieldQuantity;entity.YieldUnitOfMeasureId=request.YieldUnitOfMeasureId;AddRecipeLines(entity,request.Lines,context);dbContext.Recipes.Add(entity);AddStatus(entity,"Created",context);return await SaveAsync(()=>Map(entity),token);}
    public async Task<CatalogResult<RecipeResponse>> UpdateRecipeAsync(Guid id,UpdateRecipeRequest request,CatalogRequestContext context,CancellationToken token){var entity=await dbContext.Recipes.Include(x=>x.Lines).SingleOrDefaultAsync(x=>x.Id==id,token);if(entity is null)return NotFound<RecipeResponse>();var errors=await ValidateRecipeAsync(request.Code,request.Name,entity.MenuItemId,request.YieldQuantity,request.YieldUnitOfMeasureId,request.Lines,id,token);if(errors.Length>0)return Validation<RecipeResponse>(errors);if(!ApplyVersion(entity,request.Version))return VersionFailure<RecipeResponse>();UpdateStatus(entity,request.IsActive,request.Reason,context);var now=Now;foreach(var line in entity.Lines.Where(x=>x.RevokedAt is null)){line.RevokedAt=now;line.RevokedBy=context.Actor;}entity.Code=Code(request.Code);entity.Name=request.Name.Trim();entity.YieldQuantity=request.YieldQuantity;entity.YieldUnitOfMeasureId=request.YieldUnitOfMeasureId;AddRecipeLines(entity,request.Lines,context);Touch(entity,context);return await SaveAsync(()=>Map(entity),token);}

    public async Task<CatalogResult<InspectionRequirementResponse[]>> GetInspectionRequirementsAsync(CancellationToken token){var entities=await dbContext.InspectionRequirements.AsNoTracking().Include(x=>x.Criteria).OrderBy(x=>x.Name).ToArrayAsync(token);return CatalogResult<InspectionRequirementResponse[]>.Success(entities.Select(Map).ToArray());}
    public async Task<CatalogResult<InspectionRequirementResponse>> CreateInspectionRequirementAsync(CreateInspectionRequirementRequest request,CatalogRequestContext context,CancellationToken token){var errors=await ValidateInspectionAsync(request.ItemId,request.ItemGroupId,request.Name,request.Criteria,null,token);if(errors.Length>0)return Validation<InspectionRequirementResponse>(errors);var entity=New<InspectionRequirement>(context);entity.ItemId=request.ItemId;entity.ItemGroupId=request.ItemGroupId;entity.Name=request.Name.Trim();entity.IsRequired=request.IsRequired;AddCriteria(entity,request.Criteria,context);dbContext.InspectionRequirements.Add(entity);AddStatus(entity,"Created",context);return await SaveAsync(()=>Map(entity),token);}
    public async Task<CatalogResult<InspectionRequirementResponse>> UpdateInspectionRequirementAsync(Guid id,UpdateInspectionRequirementRequest request,CatalogRequestContext context,CancellationToken token){var entity=await dbContext.InspectionRequirements.Include(x=>x.Criteria).SingleOrDefaultAsync(x=>x.Id==id,token);if(entity is null)return NotFound<InspectionRequirementResponse>();var errors=await ValidateInspectionAsync(entity.ItemId,entity.ItemGroupId,request.Name,request.Criteria,id,token);if(errors.Length>0)return Validation<InspectionRequirementResponse>(errors);if(!ApplyVersion(entity,request.Version))return VersionFailure<InspectionRequirementResponse>();UpdateStatus(entity,request.IsActive,request.Reason,context);var now=Now;foreach(var criterion in entity.Criteria.Where(x=>x.RevokedAt is null)){criterion.RevokedAt=now;criterion.RevokedBy=context.Actor;}entity.Name=request.Name.Trim();entity.IsRequired=request.IsRequired;AddCriteria(entity,request.Criteria,context);Touch(entity,context);return await SaveAsync(()=>Map(entity),token);}
    public async Task<CatalogResult<CatalogStatusHistoryResponse[]>> GetStatusHistoryAsync(string? entityType,Guid? entityId,int take,CancellationToken token){var query=dbContext.StatusHistory.AsNoTracking();if(!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(entityType))query=query.Where(x=>x.EntityType==entityType);if(entityId is not null)query=query.Where(x=>x.EntityId==entityId);var entities=await query.OrderByDescending(x=>x.ChangedAt).Take(Math.Clamp(take,1,500)).ToArrayAsync(token);return CatalogResult<CatalogStatusHistoryResponse[]>.Success(entities.Select(x=>new CatalogStatusHistoryResponse(x.Id,x.EntityType,x.EntityId,x.PreviousStatus,x.NewStatus,x.Reason,x.ChangedBy,x.ChangedAt)).ToArray());}

    private T New<T>(CatalogRequestContext context) where T:AuditedMasterData,new()=>new(){Id=Guid.NewGuid(),CreatedAt=Now,CreatedBy=context.Actor};
    private void Touch(AuditedMasterData entity,CatalogRequestContext context){entity.ModifiedAt=Now;entity.ModifiedBy=context.Actor;}
    private void AddStatus(AuditedMasterData entity,string reason,CatalogRequestContext context)=>dbContext.StatusHistory.Add(new(){Id=Guid.NewGuid(),EntityType=entity.GetType().Name,EntityId=entity.Id,PreviousStatus="None",NewStatus="Active",Reason=reason,ChangedBy=context.Actor,ChangedAt=Now});
    private void UpdateStatus(AuditedMasterData entity,bool isActive,string reason,CatalogRequestContext context){if(entity.IsActive==isActive)return;dbContext.StatusHistory.Add(new(){Id=Guid.NewGuid(),EntityType=entity.GetType().Name,EntityId=entity.Id,PreviousStatus=entity.IsActive?"Active":"Inactive",NewStatus=isActive?"Active":"Inactive",Reason=string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(reason)?"Status changed":reason.Trim(),ChangedBy=context.Actor,ChangedAt=Now});entity.IsActive=isActive;}
    private bool ApplyVersion(AuditedMasterData entity,string version){try{var bytes=Convert.FromBase64String(version);var property=dbContext.Entry(entity).Property(x=>x.RowVersion);if(bytes.Length==0&&property.CurrentValue.Length==0)return true;property.OriginalValue=bytes;return bytes.Length>0;}catch(FormatException){return false;}}
    private async Task<CatalogResult<T>> SaveAsync<T>(Func<T> value,CancellationToken token){try{await dbContext.SaveChangesAsync(token);return CatalogResult<T>.Success(value());}catch(DbUpdateConcurrencyException){return VersionFailure<T>();}catch(DbUpdateException){return Conflict<T>("The change conflicts with existing Catalog data.");}}
    private static async Task<bool> CodeExistsAsync<T>(DbSet<T> set,string code,Guid? id,CancellationToken token) where T:AuditedMasterData {var normalized=Code(code);return await set.AnyAsync(x=>x.Id!=id&&EF.Property<string>(x,"Code")==normalized,token);}
    private async Task<string?> ValidateItemReferencesAsync(Guid unitId,Guid? groupId,CatalogItemType type,CancellationToken token){if(!await dbContext.UnitsOfMeasure.AnyAsync(x=>x.Id==unitId&&x.IsActive,token))return "The selected unit is invalid or inactive.";if(groupId is not null){var group=await dbContext.ItemGroups.AsNoTracking().SingleOrDefaultAsync(x=>x.Id==groupId&&x.IsActive,token);if(group is null)return "The selected item group is invalid or inactive.";if(group.AppliesTo is not null&&group.AppliesTo!=type)return "The item group does not apply to this item type.";}return null;}
    private async Task<string[]> ValidateRecipeAsync(string code,string name,Guid menuItemId,decimal yield,Guid yieldUnit,RecipeLineRequest[] lines,Guid? id,CancellationToken token){var errors=ValidateCodeName(code,name).ToList();if(yield<=0)errors.Add("Yield quantity must be positive.");if(lines.Length==0)errors.Add("At least one recipe line is required.");if(lines.Any(x=>x.Quantity<=0||x.WastagePercentage is <0 or >100))errors.Add("Recipe quantities must be positive and wastage percentages between 0 and 100.");if(lines.Select(x=>x.Sequence).Distinct().Count()!=lines.Length)errors.Add("Recipe-line sequences must be unique.");if(await CodeExistsAsync(dbContext.Recipes,code,id,token))errors.Add("The recipe code already exists.");if(!await dbContext.Items.AnyAsync(x=>x.Id==menuItemId&&x.ItemType==CatalogItemType.MenuItem&&x.IsActive,token))errors.Add("The selected menu item is invalid or inactive.");if(!await dbContext.UnitsOfMeasure.AnyAsync(x=>x.Id==yieldUnit&&x.IsActive,token))errors.Add("The yield unit is invalid or inactive.");var ingredientIds=lines.Select(x=>x.IngredientItemId).Distinct().ToArray();var ingredientCount=await dbContext.Items.CountAsync(x=>ingredientIds.Contains(x.Id)&&x.IsActive&&x.ItemType!=CatalogItemType.MenuItem,token);if(ingredientCount!=ingredientIds.Length)errors.Add("Every ingredient must be an active raw or packaging material.");return errors.ToArray();}
    private async Task<string[]> ValidateInspectionAsync(Guid? itemId,Guid? groupId,string name,InspectionCriterionRequest[] criteria,Guid? id,CancellationToken token){var errors=new List<string>();if((itemId is null)==(groupId is null))errors.Add("Select exactly one item or item group.");if(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name)||name.Trim().Length>200)errors.Add("A requirement name is required.");if(criteria.Length==0)errors.Add("At least one inspection criterion is required.");if(criteria.Select(x=>x.Sequence).Distinct().Count()!=criteria.Length)errors.Add("Criterion sequences must be unique.");if(criteria.Any(x=>string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(x.Name)||x.Name.Trim().Length>200||!Enum.TryParse<InspectionResultType>(x.ResultType,true,out var resultType)||!Enum.IsDefined(resultType)))errors.Add("Every criterion requires a name up to 200 characters and valid result type.");if(itemId is not null&&!await dbContext.Items.AnyAsync(x=>x.Id==itemId&&x.IsActive,token))errors.Add("The selected item is invalid or inactive.");if(groupId is not null&&!await dbContext.ItemGroups.AnyAsync(x=>x.Id==groupId&&x.IsActive,token))errors.Add("The selected item group is invalid or inactive.");if(await dbContext.InspectionRequirements.AnyAsync(x=>x.Id!=id&&x.IsActive&&((itemId!=null&&x.ItemId==itemId)||(groupId!=null&&x.ItemGroupId==groupId)),token))errors.Add("An active inspection requirement already exists for this target.");return errors.ToArray();}
    private void AddRecipeLines(Recipe recipe,IEnumerable<RecipeLineRequest> lines,CatalogRequestContext context){foreach(var line in lines)recipe.Lines.Add(new(){Id=Guid.NewGuid(),IngredientItemId=line.IngredientItemId,Quantity=line.Quantity,WastagePercentage=line.WastagePercentage,Sequence=line.Sequence,AddedAt=Now,AddedBy=context.Actor});}
    private void AddCriteria(InspectionRequirement requirement,IEnumerable<InspectionCriterionRequest> criteria,CatalogRequestContext context){foreach(var item in criteria){Enum.TryParse<InspectionResultType>(item.ResultType,true,out var type);requirement.Criteria.Add(new(){Id=Guid.NewGuid(),Name=item.Name.Trim(),ResultType=type,MinimumValue=item.MinimumValue?.Trim(),MaximumValue=item.MaximumValue?.Trim(),Unit=item.Unit?.Trim(),IsMandatory=item.IsMandatory,Sequence=item.Sequence,AddedAt=Now,AddedBy=context.Actor});}}
    private static string[] ValidateUnit(string code,string name,string symbol,string category,int decimals){var errors=ValidateCodeName(code,name).ToList();if(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(symbol)||symbol.Trim().Length>20)errors.Add("A unit symbol up to 20 characters is required.");if(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(category)||category.Trim().Length>50)errors.Add("A unit category up to 50 characters is required.");if(decimals is <0 or >6)errors.Add("Decimal places must be between 0 and 6.");return errors.ToArray();}
    private static string[] ValidateCodeName(string code,string name){var errors=new List<string>();var trimmedCode=code.Trim();if(trimmedCode.Length==0||trimmedCode.Length>30||trimmedCode.Any(x=>!char.IsLetterOrDigit(x)&&x!='-'))errors.Add("A code up to 30 letters, digits, or hyphens is required.");if(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name)||name.Trim().Length>200)errors.Add("A name up to 200 characters is required.");return errors.ToArray();}
    private static string[] ValidateParty(string code,string name,string email,string phone){var errors=ValidateCodeName(code,name).ToList();if(email.Length>0&&!IsEmail(email))errors.Add("The email address is invalid.");if(!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(phone)&&!IsInternationalPhone(phone))errors.Add("Phone must include a country code (+ and 8 to 15 digits), for example +923001234567.");return errors.ToArray();}
    private static bool IsInternationalPhone(string phone)=>Regex.IsMatch(phone.Trim(),@"^\+[1-9][0-9]{7,14}$",RegexOptions.CultureInvariant);
    private static string[] ValidateItem(string code,string name,string typeText,decimal? price,decimal cost,int? shelfLife,out CatalogItemType type){var errors=ValidateCodeName(code,name).ToList();if(!Enum.TryParse(typeText,true,out type)||!Enum.IsDefined(type))errors.Add("Item type must be MenuItem, RawMaterial, or PackagingMaterial.");if(price<0||cost<0)errors.Add("Prices and costs cannot be negative.");if(type==CatalogItemType.MenuItem&&price is null)errors.Add("Menu items require a sales price.");if(type!=CatalogItemType.MenuItem&&price is not null)errors.Add("Only menu items may have a sales price.");if(shelfLife<=0)errors.Add("Shelf life must be positive when supplied.");return errors.ToArray();}
    private static bool ParseOptionalItemType(string text,out CatalogItemType? type){if(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(text)){type=null;return true;}if(Enum.TryParse<CatalogItemType>(text,true,out var parsed)&&Enum.IsDefined(parsed)){type=parsed;return true;}type=null;return false;}
    private static bool IsEmail(string email){try{return new MailAddress(email).Address.Equals(email.Trim(),StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);}catch(FormatException){return false;}}
    private static string Code(string value)=>value.Trim().ToUpperInvariant();
    private static void SetVendor(Vendor x,string code,string name,string contact,string phone,string email,string address,string tax){x.Code=Code(code);x.Name=name.Trim();x.ContactPerson=contact.Trim();x.Phone=phone.Trim();x.Email=email.Trim();x.Address=address.Trim();x.TaxRegistrationNumber=tax.Trim();}
    private static CatalogResult<T> Validation<T>(params string[] errors)=>CatalogResult<T>.Failure(CatalogResultStatus.Validation,errors);
    private static CatalogResult<T> Conflict<T>(string error)=>CatalogResult<T>.Failure(CatalogResultStatus.Conflict,error);
    private static CatalogResult<T> NotFound<T>()=>CatalogResult<T>.Failure(CatalogResultStatus.NotFound,"The Catalog record was not found.");
    private static CatalogResult<T> VersionFailure<T>()=>Conflict<T>("The Catalog record changed. Reload it and try again.");
    private static string Version(AuditedMasterData x)=>Convert.ToBase64String(x.RowVersion);
    private static UnitOfMeasureResponse Map(UnitOfMeasure x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.Symbol,x.Category,x.DecimalPlaces,x.IsActive,Version(x));
    private static ItemGroupResponse Map(ItemGroup x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.AppliesTo?.ToString()??string.Empty,x.RequiresInspection,x.IsActive,Version(x));
    private static CatalogItemResponse Map(CatalogItem x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.Description,x.ItemType.ToString(),x.UnitOfMeasureId,x.ItemGroupId,x.SalesPrice,x.StandardCost,x.ShelfLifeDays,x.RequiresInspection,x.IsActive,Version(x));
    private static CustomerResponse Map(Customer x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.Phone,x.Email,x.Address,x.IsActive,Version(x));
    private static VendorResponse Map(Vendor x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.ContactPerson,x.Phone,x.Email,x.Address,x.TaxRegistrationNumber,x.IsActive,Version(x));
    private static DiningTableResponse Map(DiningTable x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.Capacity,x.Area,x.IsActive,Version(x));
    private static WarehouseResponse Map(Warehouse x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.Address,x.IsActive,Version(x));
    private static RiderResponse Map(Rider x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.Phone,x.VehicleRegistration,x.IsAvailable,x.IsActive,Version(x));
    private static RecipeResponse Map(Recipe x)=>new(x.Id,x.Code,x.Name,x.MenuItemId,x.YieldQuantity,x.YieldUnitOfMeasureId,x.IsActive,x.Lines.Where(y=>y.RevokedAt is null).OrderBy(y=>y.Sequence).Select(y=>new RecipeLineResponse(y.Id,y.IngredientItemId,y.Quantity,y.WastagePercentage,y.Sequence)).ToArray(),Version(x));
    private static InspectionRequirementResponse Map(InspectionRequirement x)=>new(x.Id,x.ItemId,x.ItemGroupId,x.Name,x.IsRequired,x.IsActive,x.Criteria.Where(y=>y.RevokedAt is null).OrderBy(y=>y.Sequence).Select(y=>new InspectionCriterionResponse(y.Id,y.Name,y.ResultType.ToString(),y.MinimumValue,y.MaximumValue,y.Unit,y.IsMandatory,y.Sequence)).ToArray(),Version(x));
}
